{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.mei.drive",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "今天的工作要开车去",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.mei.drive",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.mei.drive",
    "idolId": "mei",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "哟……来接我，谢谢啦制作人。",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "今天的目的地坐电车不方便，别在意。",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "啊哈哈，接送什么的超——有偶像的感觉诶～！",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，也许吧。这种程度的话，随时都行。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "真的～！？那，下次去兜风吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "兜风？",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "嗯！うち家那边有海，天气好的时候超舒服的～",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（她说到家里那边的时候，语速变快了。）",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "好啊，有机会去。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "说定了哦！",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（窗外是海。她安静了一会儿，看着窗外。）",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "……制作人。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯？",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "うち，其实有点怕上台。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "平时这样说说笑笑的，没关系。可是一站到人前，就会僵住。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（第一次听她说这个。）",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "……啊，说了奇怪的话。忘了吧～",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不，没忘。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "怕的话，就先从小的场子开始。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "……嗯。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "mei",
        "text": "谢谢。"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
